(6997166, 1057677, 15711, '<td valign="top">Is that a raquetball court?  My dad taught that and squash at the Univ. of Texas as part of their Physical Education program, so this bring a few twinges to my heart.  Thanks for that. :)</td>', 'Is that a raquetball court?  My dad taught that and squash at the Univ. of Texas as part of their Physical Education program, so this bring a few twinges to my heart.  Thanks for that. :)', '2013-03-11 10:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
