(6997604, 1057595, 117534, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot, personaly I think you overdid the guassian blurr, I see too many sharp edges on the bird... I tend to do this very thing, something that a DPCer told me that really HELPS if your gonna use this much blurr is grab the smudge tool (very small) and 50 or lower, and go around the sharpish looking edges on the bird so help soften and set him in the photo.. <br/> <br/>Your foucs is fantastic!</td>', 'Nice Shot, personaly I think you overdid the guassian blurr, I see too many sharp edges on the bird... I tend to do this very thing, something that a DPCer told me that really HELPS if your gonna use this much blurr is grab the smudge tool (very small) and 50 or lower, and go around the sharpish looking edges on the bird so help soften and set him in the photo..  Your foucs is fantastic!', '2013-03-12 01:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
