(6997758, 1057551, 100495, '<td valign="top">When he finished the washing-up, Dave would stare achingly at the bubbles in the sink, remembering his happier days. The reflections reminded him of bright days at sea with his ship breaking through the waves leaving a trail behind it. Occasionally he''d see the reflection of his wife and remember how she''d taken him away from the sea and away from his freedom. Just another 4 hours until he filled the bowl again and made another set of bubble memories.</td>', 'When he finished the washing-up, Dave would stare achingly at the bubbles in the sink, remembering his happier days. The reflections reminded him of bright days at sea with his ship breaking through the waves leaving a trail behind it. Occasionally he''d see the reflection of his wife and remember how she''d taken him away from the sea and away from his freedom. Just another 4 hours until he filled the bowl again and made another set of bubble memories.', '2013-03-12 09:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6997763, 1057670, 158788, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!!</td>', 'Awesome!!!', '2013-03-12 09:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6997765, 1057599, 100495, '<td valign="top">The recycled water filter line took used water from the sump on level 7 and removed large objects before they reached the recycling pump. Without the filter, the pump would seize, and the precious water could not reach the recycling assembly. Without clean water they would die before they reached Mars or the re-supply vessel they could intercept in an emergency. The only other pump, on level 3, failed 2 weeks ago, and the level 7 pump was beginning to make suspicious noises.<br/> <br/>It was Dave''s job to change the recycling pump filters, but he''d never known where they were or how to change them. He''d slept through that part of the brief.</td>', 'The recycled water filter line took used water from the sump on level 7 and removed large objects before they reached the recycling pump. Without the filter, the pump would seize, and the precious water could not reach the recycling assembly. Without clean water they would die before they reached Mars or the re-supply vessel they could intercept in an emergency. The only other pump, on level 3, failed 2 weeks ago, and the level 7 pump was beginning to make suspicious noises. It was Dave''s job to change the recycling pump filters, but he''d never known where they were or how to change them. He''d slept through that part of the brief.', '2013-03-12 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
