(7000202, 1057595, 138630, '<td valign="top">A common robin - common in this part of the world, at least - on a common metal stake.  And such a welcome sight in the early spring.  The detail is perfectly lovely - look at the way those feathers lie - as is the background blur that sets him off.  One of my top two.  10  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'A common robin - common in this part of the world, at least - on a common metal stake.  And such a welcome sight in the early spring.  The detail is perfectly lovely - look at the way those feathers lie - as is the background blur that sets him off.  One of my top two.  10  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-14 21:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000203, 1057640, 138630, '<td valign="top">The tones, the composition, the play of light and shadow, the shapes and lines, and most of all the simplicity of the composition - just lovely.  One of my top two.  10  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'The tones, the composition, the play of light and shadow, the shapes and lines, and most of all the simplicity of the composition - just lovely.  One of my top two.  10  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-14 21:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000207, 1057341, 138630, '<td valign="top">The golden color and light on the reflecting surfaces, the patterns in the ridges of sand and rivulets of water - just lovely.  Top ten for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'The golden color and light on the reflecting surfaces, the patterns in the ridges of sand and rivulets of water - just lovely.  Top ten for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-14 21:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000211, 1057408, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love the way this dainty remnant of last season''s beauty, beautiful in its dried state that emphasizes the delicate veining and tones, is poking through the snow.  Very nice.  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'I love the way this dainty remnant of last season''s beauty, beautiful in its dried state that emphasizes the delicate veining and tones, is poking through the snow.  Very nice.  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-14 21:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000217, 1057113, 138630, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, it''s the "lean" that draws attention to this vessel which might well be an ordinary water jug.  I love the "context of a village" look here and the tones are very nice.  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Ah yes, it''s the "lean" that draws attention to this vessel which might well be an ordinary water jug.  I love the "context of a village" look here and the tones are very nice.  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-14 21:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000219, 1057656, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the silvery bokeh background and the detail of the single dried leaf, barely hanging on.  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Love the silvery bokeh background and the detail of the single dried leaf, barely hanging on.  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-14 21:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000221, 1057229, 138630, '<td valign="top">Terrific mood and light and a beautiful scene with the light spilling down the hillside as it is.  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Terrific mood and light and a beautiful scene with the light spilling down the hillside as it is.  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-14 21:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000224, 1057481, 138630, '<td valign="top">This one got bumped several times by me.  Not sure whether it was the cracks in the leather of these well worn slippers or the darned toes, but it''s an ahhh image for sure.  What feels better than slipping your feet out of shoes and into your favorite slippers at the end of a long day?  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'This one got bumped several times by me.  Not sure whether it was the cracks in the leather of these well worn slippers or the darned toes, but it''s an ahhh image for sure.  What feels better than slipping your feet out of shoes and into your favorite slippers at the end of a long day?  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-14 21:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000225, 1057455, 138630, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for stair and these are nicely unusual - great lines, light and tones.  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for stair and these are nicely unusual - great lines, light and tones.  Top 10 for me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-14 21:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000477, 1057640, 114285, '<td valign="top">If this one doesn''t win, I''ll eat my left shoe.<br/> <br/>Superbly done, a masterpiece of art, so simple and really elegant, you know I love this type of photo, the lighting, the comp, the perfect tones, all around just awesome and I''m wishing now I did something like this, instant fave from the minute I saw it, 10!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a></td>', 'If this one doesn''t win, I''ll eat my left shoe. Superbly done, a masterpiece of art, so simple and really elegant, you know I love this type of photo, the lighting, the comp, the perfect tones, all around just awesome and I''m wishing now I did something like this, instant fave from the minute I saw it, 10! ', '2013-03-15 02:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
