(7001111, 1057608, 157380, '<td valign="top">This works for me. The colours, contrasts, and textures come together in just the right way. The warming/yellowing of the image is subtle and only when returning to analyse the image in more depth do i even realise it has been done. The brush itself is an artifact of some baeuty and it''s has that well loved look to it, aged but not excessively abused. To me this is what wabi sabi seams to mean. Showing signs of both wear and care.</td>', 'This works for me. The colours, contrasts, and textures come together in just the right way. The warming/yellowing of the image is subtle and only when returning to analyse the image in more depth do i even realise it has been done. The brush itself is an artifact of some baeuty and it''s has that well loved look to it, aged but not excessively abused. To me this is what wabi sabi seams to mean. Showing signs of both wear and care.', '2013-03-15 21:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
