(7001845, 1057621, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is so well seen and framed.  I love the warm tones, strong lines, and simple punch of the composition.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'This is so well seen and framed.  I love the warm tones, strong lines, and simple punch of the composition.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-17 18:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001847, 1057600, 138630, '<td valign="top">Even with the title, I''m not sure what I''m looking at but I love the very fine line of rough focus flowing through the frame and the way the light and colors blend softly on either side of it.  Lovely line.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Even with the title, I''m not sure what I''m looking at but I love the very fine line of rough focus flowing through the frame and the way the light and colors blend softly on either side of it.  Lovely line.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-17 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001849, 1057199, 138630, '<td valign="top">Tempted to bump and may yet - adore the scene, composition, tones, light.  I am not normally a person who adds or subtracts points for a frame, but I really think it detracts here.  Can''t quite figure out why as it seems well chosen in terms of style and the jagged, torn look should complement the subject.  Maybe I don''t like it because it seems affected, an unnecessary embellishment to an otherwise perfect composition.  8  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Tempted to bump and may yet - adore the scene, composition, tones, light.  I am not normally a person who adds or subtracts points for a frame, but I really think it detracts here.  Can''t quite figure out why as it seems well chosen in terms of style and the jagged, torn look should complement the subject.  Maybe I don''t like it because it seems affected, an unnecessary embellishment to an otherwise perfect composition.  8  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-17 18:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001850, 1057599, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the lines, simplicity of the composition, and the white and black.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Love the lines, simplicity of the composition, and the white and black.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-17 18:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001851, 1057210, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very ordinary and so beautiful.  It''s the heaviness of the snow , almost filling the frame with its weight, that I like best.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Very ordinary and so beautiful.  It''s the heaviness of the snow , almost filling the frame with its weight, that I like best.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-17 18:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001852, 1057458, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love the subject, the light, the tones.  My quibble (and it''s exactly that - a nitpick) is with the composition.  I feel as if it should be rotated ever so slightly cc and re-cropped - more space on top for sure and probably some off left and bottom.  But maybe my unease is due to its imperfection  :)  8  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'I love the subject, the light, the tones.  My quibble (and it''s exactly that - a nitpick) is with the composition.  I feel as if it should be rotated ever so slightly cc and re-cropped - more space on top for sure and probably some off left and bottom.  But maybe my unease is due to its imperfection  :)  8  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-17 18:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001853, 1056864, 138630, '<td valign="top">Another where the subject, lines and textures please me a lot.  Well seen.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Another where the subject, lines and textures please me a lot.  Well seen.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-17 18:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
