(7001955, 1057207, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the set-up here - but somehow it feels too set up for the challenge.  I think the pot should feel slightly more comfortable in its surroundings.  This feels like someone who is already uncertain and insecure and finds herself over-dressed for a party.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Love the set-up here - but somehow it feels too set up for the challenge.  I think the pot should feel slightly more comfortable in its surroundings.  This feels like someone who is already uncertain and insecure and finds herself over-dressed for a party.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-03-17 20:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
