(7001964, 1057577, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s lovely, but I feel I am primarily evaluating the talent of the graffiti artist rather than the photography. There is clearly some skill involved from the photographic side, however I feel it is mostly a picture of a picture.</td>', 'It''s lovely, but I feel I am primarily evaluating the talent of the graffiti artist rather than the photography. There is clearly some skill involved from the photographic side, however I feel it is mostly a picture of a picture.', '2013-03-17 20:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
