(7002113, 1057640, 82999, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow I''m so glad this was yours, I had a feeling it might be, just wonderful, it reminded me of my milk shot, well done on another blue.<br/> <br/>Oh yeah, edited to add, I''m glad I don''t have to eat my left shoe, lol! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>As of this morning, the score was around 6.9.  So when it started to drop drastically, I immediately thought you might be eating your shoe!  Very kind of you to compare this to your milk shot considering how much I like that shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Wow I''m so glad this was yours, I had a feeling it might be, just wonderful, it reminded me of my milk shot, well done on another blue. Oh yeah, edited to add, I''m glad I don''t have to eat my left shoe, lol!   As of this morning, the score was around 6.9.  So when it started to drop drastically, I immediately thought you might be eating your shoe!  Very kind of you to compare this to your milk shot considering how much I like that shot.', '2013-03-18 00:20:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7002115, 1057229, 54446, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon, Margaret!  This does meet the challenge, exceptionally well.  It''s a very pleasant scene and reflects much understanding of light to capture the variable contrast and impressive drama.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon, Margaret!  This does meet the challenge, exceptionally well.  It''s a very pleasant scene and reflects much understanding of light to capture the variable contrast and impressive drama.', '2013-03-18 00:23:08.000000', NULL, 0),
