(7002117, 1057650, 136989, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Love the vibrant and contrasting colors. So many shapes to stare at and consider in abstract.</td>', 'Wonderful! Love the vibrant and contrasting colors. So many shapes to stare at and consider in abstract.', '2013-03-18 00:23:16.000000', NULL, 0),
