(7002126, 1057560, 136989, '<td valign="top">This so should have placed higher.  Love the lines and curves.  I wonder what it would look like with the light haze of green as the leaves come in this spring.</td>', 'This so should have placed higher.  Love the lines and curves.  I wonder what it would look like with the light haze of green as the leaves come in this spring.', '2013-03-18 00:27:20.000000', NULL, 0),
